|---------|---------|-------------|
| Symbolic algebra | ✅ | ✅ (via SymPy) |
| Pattern matching | ✅ | ✅ |
| Calculus | ✅ | ✅ |
| Linear algebra | ✅ | ✅ (via NumPy) |
| Number theory | ✅ | ✅ |
| Wolfram-style syntax | ✅ | ✅ |
| Jupyter notebooks | ✅ | ✅ |
| LaTeX output | ✅ | ✅ |
| Plotting | ✅ | ✅ (via Matplotlib) |
| Physics units | ✅ | ✅ |
